<nav class="noa-world-links" aria-label="세계관 경로"><a href="/noa2.php">홈</a><a href="/noa-world.php" <?=!$selected?'aria-current="page"':''?>>NOA WORLD</a><?php if($selected):?><span aria-current="page">ACT.<?= (int)$selected['act_number']?></span><?php endif;?></nav>
<p class="noa-eyebrow">MUSIC / CHARACTERS / STORIES</p><h1>NOA WORLD</h1><p class="noa-muted">노래의 장면을 따라, 노아와 노엘의 이야기 속으로.</p>
